    13	
    14	Earlier the same day the owner directed: “你可以對齊全部參數吧 基本建設都在了isaiah, 我們盡量對齊”. An alignment review then listed two items as the owner's to decide: the optimizer-step cadence (batch options A/B plus `target_kl`) and the critic/value-distillation semantics. The owner replied:
