-- **Workload headroom** against the 2^31 limit at the preset: rollout 256 rows (trunk 23×, heads 43×); training minibatch 1,024 rows (trunk 5.8×, heads 10.8×). Teacher-precompute chunks of 16,384 rows exceed one chunk, so both the trunk and the heads now chunk them instead of failing. A startup workload assertion over config shapes belongs to Task 3.4.
